cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SugarcaneAI: Novel Lightweight Explainable Uncertainty-Aware Multimodal Hybrid Vision Transformer for Sugarcane Disease Detection"
abstract: >
  A novel multimodal AI framework that fuses high-resolution leaf images with
  real-time environmental metadata (temperature, relative humidity, soil moisture,
  rainfall) using Cross-Attention to resolve visual ambiguities in early-stage
  sugarcane disease detection. The framework includes uncertainty quantification
  via Monte Carlo Dropout, explainability via Grad-CAM++, and knowledge
  distillation for edge deployment.
